29:21.500 --> 29:34.900
E quindi, sorry for you Patricia, even though you are the only Baroness here, you are the last one because of your family name, while Renault is the first one.

29:45.460 --> 30:02.780
Ok, well, I will comply with the order and the sense of direction lines, and I think I'll stop here because it certainly is sufficient by way of an introduction.

30:04.360 --> 30:29.340
Bravo, just only this remark Renault that e pur si muove might mean both that we are still going according to the Monet functionalism or that we are muddling through.

30:30.140 --> 30:45.460
Because I'm well aware of what Monet had in mind and was practicing and I would be happy to practice that method step after step knowing where I'm heading to.

30:45.460 --> 31:07.020
But if I'm muddling through, run by facts and necessities, well at that point it makes a difference and Monet could not be happy to attribute to him this kind of process, so perhaps we are doing both things.

